ll it after explicit direction or permission from the user.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Object, or class:/Script/Module.Class for static library functions. (Reference to Object: node id (n12), node path, actor:Name or object path)"},"function":{"type":"string","description":"Function name, e.g. \"K2_GetActorLocation\" (see list_functions)."},"args":{"description":"Arguments by parameter name, e.g. {\"NewLocation\": [0, 0, 100]}. (Any JSON value)"}},"required":["target","function"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","title":"RuntimeCallResult","properties":{"return":{"description":"Return value (null for functions without one). (Any JSON value)"},"outputs":{"description":"Out parameters by name. (Any JSON value)"},"defaulted":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Parameters that were not passed and used their zero/default value."},"undoable":{"type":"boolean","description":"False when the function may have changed state (only pure/const functions are side-effect free)."}},"description":"Return value, out parameters, defaulted parameter names and whether the call was side-effect free."}},"required":["returnValue"]},"undoable":false,"irreversible":true,"requires_world":false,"async":false},{"name":"describe_enum","function":"DescribeEnum","description":"Describes an enum: its value names (what enum properties and arguments accept) and numbers. Fails if no loaded enum has that name; similar names are suggested.\nReturns: Name, path, whether it is a bit-flag enum, and its values in declaration order.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"enum":{"type":"string","description":"Enum name or path, e.g. \"ECollisionChannel\", \"EComponentMobility\" or \"/Script/Engine.ELightUnits\"."}},"required":["enum"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"returnValue":{"type":"object","titl